{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence of pairs (","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"x"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" represents a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consecutive integer starting at zero and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"x"}]},{"text":" represents an element of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt8\/Words-swift.struct\/enumerated()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"enumerated()","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"Swift","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS"},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"10.10","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS"},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"2.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"externalID":"s:STsE10enumerateds18EnumeratedSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s5UInt8V5WordsV","modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enumerated","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/uint8\/words-swift.struct\/enumerated()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt8","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt8\/Words-swift.struct"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enumerated"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EnumeratedSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/EnumeratedSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of pairs enumerating the sequence."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This example enumerates the characters of the string “Swift” and prints","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each character along with its place in the string.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["for (n, c) in \"Swift\".enumerated() {","    print(\"\\(n): '\\(c)'\")","}","\/\/ Prints \"0: 'S'\"","\/\/ Prints \"1: 'w'\"","\/\/ Prints \"2: 'i'\"","\/\/ Prints \"3: 'f'\"","\/\/ Prints \"4: 't'\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When you enumerate a collection, the integer part of each pair is a counter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the enumeration, but is not necessarily the index of the paired value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These counters can be used as indices only in instances of zero-based,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"integer-indexed collections, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"Array","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContiguousArray"},{"type":"text","text":". For"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other collections the counters may be out of range or of the wrong type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to use as an index. To iterate over the elements of a collection with its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indices, use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"zip(_:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" function.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This example iterates over the indices and elements of a set, building a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"list consisting of indices of names with five or fewer letters.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let names: Set = [\"Sofia\", \"Camilla\", \"Martina\", \"Mateo\", \"Nicolás\"]","var shorterIndices: [Set<String>.Index] = []","for (i, name) in zip(names.indices, names) {","    if name.count <= 5 {","        shorterIndices.append(i)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Now that the ","type":"text"},{"code":"shorterIndices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" array holds the indices of the shorter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"names","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" set, you can use those indices to access elements in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the set."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["for i in shorterIndices {","    print(names[i])","}","\/\/ Prints \"Sofia\"","\/\/ Prints \"Mateo\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(1)"}]}],"name":"Complexity","style":"note"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/UInt8/Words-swift.struct":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt8\/Words-swift.struct","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/uint8\/words-swift.struct","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Words","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Words","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A type that represents the words of this integer.","type":"text"}],"title":"UInt8.Words"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/EnumeratedSequence":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/EnumeratedSequence","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/enumeratedsequence","title":"EnumeratedSequence","abstract":[{"text":"An enumeration of the elements of a sequence or collection.","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift":{"title":"Swift","abstract":[{"text":"Build apps using a powerful open language.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swift"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/UInt8/Words-swift.struct/enumerated()":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enumerated","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt8\/Words-swift.struct\/enumerated()","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/uint8\/words-swift.struct\/enumerated()","title":"enumerated()","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence of pairs (","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"x"}]},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"text":" represents a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consecutive integer starting at zero and ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"x"}]},{"text":" represents an element of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence.","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/UInt8":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt8","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"An 8-bit unsigned integer value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"type.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"UInt8","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt8","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/uint8","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UInt8","kind":"identifier"}]}}}